00:34:21.959 --> 00:34:24.360
which is a Supreme Court, et cetera.

00:34:24.360 --> 00:34:37.600
Yes. So we have a system that also applies the law, and if necessary, coerces the people

00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:43.080
to act like a police. Shoterim means a policeman. Yes. The word Mishtara in the Hebrew, in modern

00:34:43.080 --> 00:34:48.719
Hebrew comes from the word Shoter. All right. So we are a nation. Yes. And when we demand

00:34:48.719 --> 00:34:57.159
anti-Israel, we demand it not as a religion, but as a nation. The nation of Israel, we

00:34:57.159 --> 00:35:13.800
demand our, our, our territory. Yes. The name of this halakha is called Mambrim. Somebody

00:35:13.800 --> 00:35:23.959
who rebel against authority. A human rebelling against a human authority. And the Onesh,

00:35:23.959 --> 00:35:29.239
we're going to see, I mean, we're not going to see it. We're not going to study the whole

00:35:29.239 --> 00:35:34.639
of Mambrim. The Onesh Hayamita. In other words, if a member, I'm going to explain something

00:35:34.639 --> 00:35:44.199
very simple. Concerning Bedin HaGadol, the Torah says, ahare rabbim le'atot. To whom

00:35:44.199 --> 00:35:52.239
is the, is the Torah addressing? Again, the Torah says, ahare rabbim le'atot. To whom

00:35:52.239 --> 00:35:58.959
is addressing the Torah? You know to whom? Not to you and to me. To the minority opinion.

00:35:58.959 --> 00:36:11.679
Suppose 71 this, 70 believe in, or 60 believe in this, and the other 11 believe in the other.

00:36:11.679 --> 00:36:19.840
It is imperative that the minority should accept the decision of the majority. That

00:36:19.840 --> 00:36:28.919
is democracy. Now, let me repeat again. Therefore, when the Bedin issues a Pesach, the Pesach

00:36:28.919 --> 00:36:35.800
is always unanimous. Because if I am the minority, I thought that this was Tameh, and

00:36:35.800 --> 00:36:45.000
the Bedin, whatever it is, voted that it's Tahor, I have to acquiesce to the Pesachim.

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:53.360
What happens if I refuse to accept the Pesach? That is called Zaken Mamre. What does mean

00:36:53.360 --> 00:37:01.159
the word Zaken? Member of the Supreme Court. And this member of the Supreme Court, that

00:37:01.159 --> 00:37:13.239
is Mamre, refuses to accept the majority opinion, Hayamita. That is the law. In other words,

00:37:13.239 --> 00:37:20.399
hare rabbim le'atot is said not to us, to the minority opinion. Minority opinion in

00:37:20.399 --> 00:37:28.600
the court has to accept the Pesach of the majority. The same thing is in every democracy.

00:37:28.600 --> 00:37:35.320
We are permitted to vote for Mr. A or Mr. B. At the end, the people who voted for Mr.

00:37:35.320 --> 00:37:39.800
B, but they are in the minority, they must accept Mr. A as the President of the United

00:37:39.800 --> 00:37:46.280
States. You cannot say, well, I didn't vote for you. Yes, but democracy means that the

00:37:46.280 --> 00:37:55.760
minority, that's the price that we pay for democracy. Yes? The minority, I really believe

00:37:55.760 --> 00:38:04.679
in this. In Israel, I vote, and so on. If the majority is different, I accept the majority.

00:38:04.679 --> 00:38:14.560
Now there are the, that is the laws of Mamre. Is it clear? Yes? So therefore, since in one

00:38:14.560 --> 00:38:21.560
case, not at all, I mean, I don't know if you agree with Hayamita, Hayamita, is the

00:38:21.560 --> 00:38:30.560
law that is given for the party, and therefore, you cannot be located on this law. All right?

00:38:30.560 --> 00:38:38.560
Here, how about it? That it is given to the majority in the court, so therefore, there

00:38:38.560 --> 00:38:46.840
cannot be malkut. Shemore means rebels, but means rebels not because he says, I don't

00:38:46.840 --> 00:38:56.399
agree with them. Write an article. Shemore means he issues a pesak against them. Yes?

00:38:56.399 --> 00:39:02.639
He issues a pesak against them. I think that's a wonderful policy also. I know in Argentina

00:39:02.639 --> 00:39:13.879
when I was a child, there was this, whenever they decided, they wouldn't tell you who decided

00:39:13.879 --> 00:39:20.919
or who was against it. They said, the Bedin decided this, and nobody should be more against

00:39:20.919 --> 00:39:30.639
them. That's what it is. You promote, you foster unity among people. Even if you disagree,

00:39:30.639 --> 00:39:38.639
yes? I remember, I have one case in my mind. I know that one rabbi disagreed with the,

00:39:38.639 --> 00:39:44.080
and he would not say that he disagreed or should not, he says, no, no, do it the way

00:39:44.080 --> 00:39:48.959
they do it, and so on. And that's the way it goes. There is nothing stronger to the

00:39:48.959 --> 00:39:57.120
Jew than unity. Ahadut, Aham Yisrael, and the Bedin decided this, I disagree, but you

00:39:58.120 --> 00:40:04.120
majority don't want to listen to me. I have to listen to them. It's very important. Yes?

